## Import

GitLab providers can be imported using their GitLab ID:

```shell
terraform import dokploy_gitlab.example abc123-gitlab-id
```

Or using import blocks (Terraform 1.5+):

```hcl
import {
  to = dokploy_gitlab.example
  id = "abc123-gitlab-id"
}
```

~> **Note:** Sensitive fields like `secret`, `access_token`, and `refresh_token` will not be readable after import. You will need to set these values in your configuration after import.
